    {
      "type": "code_block",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "```text\nAMIGA ACCESS:  Amiga Interface Offset Address = Base Addr.\n\n               Base Addr. + (00000 – 1FFFF) : Byte Access\n               Base Addr. + (20000 – 3FFFF) : Word Access\n               Base Addr. + (40000 – 5FFFF) : Graphic Access\n               Base Addr. + (60000 – 7FFFF) : I/O Register Access\n```",
      "bbox": [
        878,
        548,
        2129,
        845
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0078_seg_003"
    },
    {
